*.log
*.tmp
temp/
tmp/

# ---- Privacy boundary: never track tests, evals, or user-derived corpora ----
# Test and evaluation source stays local because fixtures can accidentally retain transcript,
# speaker, filename, calendar, or identity data. Product evaluation code reads each user's own
# labels/gold set from the local database; those inputs and outputs are never repository assets.
/Tests/
/AlmRecorder/Tests/
/.local-eval/
/**/.local-eval/
/eval-data/
/evaluation-data/
/test-data/
/gold-data/
/gold-set/
/fixtures/
/comparisons/
/benchmarks/

# Local-only extraction/benchmark utilities and internal work notes.
/Scripts/extract_speaker_test_set.py
/Scripts/run_speaker_pipeline_eval.sh
/docs/dev-notes/
/docs/plans/
/docs/superpowers/

